WEBVTT

00:19.330 --> 00:21.290
Yukichi, I'm home!

00:21.830 --> 00:25.540
Our company did Premium Friday
 for the first time today!

00:26.040 --> 00:29.710
There was still a little light 
in the sky, it was so moving!

00:32.130 --> 00:33.280
What's wrong?

00:34.360 --> 00:36.550
Huh? C-Could it be?

00:37.360 --> 00:40.470
Can you tell I petted the crap 
out of a doggy on my way home?

00:39.430 --> 00:40.190
Oh, my.

00:40.190 --> 00:41.560
Doggy...

00:43.120 --> 00:46.060
There were a lot of people out 
walking their dogs. I couldn't help it.

00:47.090 --> 00:48.910
Yukichi! Sorry!

00:48.910 --> 00:49.690
Sorry!

00:54.040 --> 00:58.700
Cats often get really upset if you 
pet other animals while you're out.

00:59.840 --> 01:02.290
An animal's nose can be so scary!

01:02.790 --> 01:07.470
Speaking of their noses, does your 
cat try to lick your face toner?

01:07.470 --> 01:08.500
Face toner?

01:09.090 --> 01:12.970
My family's cat loved licking my face 
right after I put on my face toner.

01:12.970 --> 01:15.010
It was hard to get away!

01:15.010 --> 01:17.430
Stop it!

01:18.490 --> 01:21.680
I've heard of cats licking 
freshly shampooed hair, too.

01:21.680 --> 01:24.430
Ow! Ow! Ow! Your tongue is so rough!

01:24.830 --> 01:27.940
That's a little scary!

01:28.650 --> 01:31.030
Thank goodness my cat doesn't do that...

01:31.030 --> 01:35.440
Yeah. It's bad for them to 
ingest any of that stuff.

01:35.440 --> 01:42.990
<b>Tremble
Tremble</b>

01:38.450 --> 01:42.990
<b>He's fine coming across them outside,
but he's a cat that can't stand them
in his territory (inside the house)</b>

01:58.880 --> 02:05.980
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

03:12.960 --> 03:16.630
Can

03:12.960 --> 03:16.630
<b>A Masterful Cat Also Goes to Birthday Parties</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:17.960
<b>A Masterful Cat Also Goes to Birthday Parties</b>

03:16.840 --> 03:17.960
Can

03:33.050 --> 03:34.930
Is it morning already?

03:34.930 --> 03:38.330
No way. I'm gonna take the day off...

03:42.090 --> 03:44.490
I'm not hungry...

03:45.980 --> 03:46.870
It's good.

04:23.310 --> 04:26.820
Fukuzawa-san is always so put together.

04:27.290 --> 04:30.740
And on top of that, she takes 
care of a cat. She's too amazing.

04:31.080 --> 04:33.280
She's a perfect example of a masterful woman.

04:33.280 --> 04:35.040
Does she really live by herself?

04:48.270 --> 04:49.100
Fukuzawa.

04:50.170 --> 04:50.940
Chief?!

04:50.940 --> 04:53.270
Sorry! I'm still in the middle of printing.

04:53.270 --> 04:55.610
No, this isn't about work.

04:55.980 --> 04:56.980
Huh?

04:58.860 --> 05:00.360
<b>To Saku-chan</b>

05:01.600 --> 05:03.980
Yume wanted me to give this to you.

05:05.150 --> 05:06.360
<b>Chief's Niece (3)</b>

05:06.360 --> 05:10.320
It's, well, an invitation 
to her birthday party.

05:10.690 --> 05:11.870
Huh?

05:12.370 --> 05:15.000
I-I-Is this really for me?!

05:15.000 --> 05:17.960
I haven't been to a birthday party in ages!

05:18.310 --> 05:21.280
I won't be there since 
I'll be on a business trip,

05:21.280 --> 05:23.920
but she really wanted me 
to give this to you.

05:23.920 --> 05:25.590
I'm so happy!

05:26.090 --> 05:26.220
<b>To Yuki-chan</b>

05:26.220 --> 05:26.340
<b>To Yuki-chan</b>

05:26.340 --> 05:26.470
<b>To Yuki-chan</b>

05:26.470 --> 05:26.970
<b>To Yuki-chan</b>

05:28.210 --> 05:33.120
She wrote one for your friend, 
Yuki-san, too. Can you pass it along?

05:43.820 --> 05:45.820
<b>Place: Yume's House
 Time: 11:30 ~</b>

05:43.820 --> 05:45.820
<b>\h\hFeel free to bring food or drink!
\hCall my mom if you have any questions
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h(080-XXXX-XXXX)</b>

05:46.760 --> 05:48.320
So that's what happened.

05:49.030 --> 05:52.720
We got invited to Yume-chan's birthday party.

05:53.110 --> 05:58.710
Well, I'm sure that Yume-chan will be 
sad, but I'll have to go alone.

06:14.020 --> 06:14.970
Yukichi?

06:14.970 --> 06:17.180
<b>Open Inari Sushi</b>

06:17.410 --> 06:18.350
No way!

06:18.350 --> 06:20.250
Hold on a second there!

06:20.250 --> 06:21.840
You're not planning to go, are you?

06:21.840 --> 06:25.640
Yume-chan's family and friends will be there!

06:25.640 --> 06:28.710
How am I supposed to explain you?!

06:29.570 --> 06:30.820
Huh?

06:30.820 --> 06:43.090
<b>Place: Yume's House
 Time: 11:30 ~
\h\h\h\h\h\h (080-XXXX-XXXX)</b>

06:31.460 --> 06:34.750
<i>Feel free to bring food or drink!</i>

06:34.750 --> 06:38.080
<i>Call my mom if you have any questions.</i>

06:38.080 --> 06:40.030
<i>Make sure to wear a costume!</i>

06:40.030 --> 06:41.340
<i>From Yume.</i>

06:41.980 --> 06:43.090
<i>Look!</i>

06:43.610 --> 06:45.080
Oh, a costume party.

06:47.530 --> 06:48.670
A costume?

06:49.890 --> 06:52.180
<i>Please wait for the next train.</i>

06:52.180 --> 06:54.560
<i>A costume party, huh?</i>

06:54.560 --> 06:57.140
<i>Maybe Yukichi can slip in 
without being found out?</i>

07:08.110 --> 07:09.780
<i>Slip in?! What am I thinking?!</i>

07:11.340 --> 07:13.660
<i>My conscience won't allow it!</i>

07:13.660 --> 07:15.080
So true!

07:15.080 --> 07:16.530
I'll be heading home first.

07:16.530 --> 07:18.500
Wow, it's rare for you 
to head home so early.

07:18.500 --> 07:20.390
Great job today.

07:21.300 --> 07:23.080
Yukichi!

07:23.080 --> 07:24.680
It's too dangerous!

07:24.680 --> 07:27.130
It's definitely way too dangerous!

07:27.650 --> 07:29.890
Wait, what are you making?

07:31.890 --> 07:36.600
Huh?! Is that stuffed animal 
a present for Yume-chan?!

07:36.960 --> 07:39.350
This is so freaking cute!

07:39.660 --> 07:41.520
It's a mini Yukichi!

07:41.930 --> 07:45.640
Make me one so I can take it to work!

07:44.520 --> 07:46.060
<b>Social custom</b>

07:46.540 --> 07:47.770
What's that?

07:48.170 --> 07:49.940
Another stuffed animal?

07:53.040 --> 07:56.950
Oh, you made a costume for me?!

08:00.020 --> 08:01.330
I'm a mouse!

08:01.330 --> 08:03.890
This reminds me of my 
school cultural festival!

08:05.810 --> 08:08.360
What's this? Is this what we're bringing?

08:08.360 --> 08:10.170
What? I can have a taste?!

08:10.820 --> 08:13.010
These are super cute!

08:15.800 --> 08:17.410
So good!

08:26.470 --> 08:27.850
Yukichi...

08:27.850 --> 08:29.340
Let's go home.

08:29.950 --> 08:32.950
Home! Home! Home! Everyone's gonna find out!

08:33.490 --> 08:36.700
Why'd we show up dressed so confidently?!

08:37.180 --> 08:40.770
And Yume-chan's house is in the neighborhood!

08:40.700 --> 08:42.450
<b>Yume's House</b>

08:40.700 --> 08:42.450
<b>Large Street</b>

08:40.700 --> 08:42.450
<b>Saku's Apartment</b>

08:41.110 --> 08:42.450
<i>Within walking distance!</i>

08:42.820 --> 08:46.200
Worst-case scenario, we might cause 
a huge scene and have to move!

08:47.600 --> 08:51.470
Saku-chan! Yuki-chan! You came!

08:51.920 --> 08:52.880
Yume-chan!

08:52.880 --> 08:55.160
Yume-chan! We're here!

08:55.160 --> 08:56.890
Hello!

08:57.810 --> 08:59.720
H-Hello!

08:59.720 --> 09:03.000
It's cold out. Let's hurry inside!

09:00.740 --> 09:03.000
Wow! He even has cat hands!

09:03.000 --> 09:05.730
Oh, uh, no, we're actually...

09:05.730 --> 09:09.040
Come in! Come in! I'm coming down!

09:10.260 --> 09:12.080
Huh? Uh, wait!

09:10.260 --> 09:12.080
Sorry for intruding!

09:12.080 --> 09:13.490
Welcome!

09:20.020 --> 09:23.000
<i>I'm so glad the chief is on a business trip!</i>

09:27.990 --> 09:31.770
Happy birthday, Yume-chan!

09:31.770 --> 09:33.010
Thank you!

09:33.010 --> 09:35.030
I'm so jealous, Yume-chan!

09:33.670 --> 09:35.030
So cute!

09:35.710 --> 09:37.490
What is that?! A stuffed animal?!

09:37.490 --> 09:38.820
Is it a stuffed bear?!

09:38.820 --> 09:41.910
<i>Why is he drawing more 
attention to himself?!</i>

09:41.910 --> 09:43.470
<i>Does he want us to move?!</i>

09:45.140 --> 09:47.230
Yuki-chan! This way!

09:47.230 --> 09:48.290
It moved!

09:48.290 --> 09:51.360
Th-That means it's alive, right?

09:51.360 --> 09:53.570
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

09:53.570 --> 09:57.450
I often see that cat 
in the neighborhood pharmacy!

09:57.450 --> 10:00.490
I've always wondered about it!

10:00.490 --> 10:04.980
It's that huge cat rumored to appear 
at the supermarket in 3-Chome!

10:04.980 --> 10:07.380
Those rumors are true?!

10:10.340 --> 10:13.050
Oh, so it's a cat suit.

10:13.500 --> 10:17.050
I've heard that technology 
nowadays is pretty amazing.

10:17.050 --> 10:20.230
But I wonder why that person 
always wears a cat costume.

10:20.570 --> 10:22.890
<i>Good job dressing up as 
someone in a cat costume!</i>

10:23.380 --> 10:27.690
Fukuzawa-san, aren't you 
from Kaoru's company?

10:27.690 --> 10:28.440
Kao...?

10:28.440 --> 10:29.680
Oh, yes!

10:29.680 --> 10:31.450
He always takes care of me!

10:31.450 --> 10:35.690
Thank you for always taking 
care of my little brother.

10:35.690 --> 10:38.740
<i>She must be Yume-chan's mother. She's so young!</i>

10:38.740 --> 10:43.420
Um, your daughter was kind enough 
to invite me here today.

10:43.420 --> 10:47.890
I heard that you played 
with her at the aquarium.

10:48.290 --> 10:51.830
I'm sorry you had to spend one 
of your days off that way.

10:51.830 --> 10:53.130
Oh, it's f-fine!

10:53.470 --> 10:56.090
I would have just slept the day 
away if I stayed home...

10:59.550 --> 11:02.290
Wait, <i>little</i> brother?!

11:02.290 --> 11:05.880
Yes, Kaoru is my little brother.

11:05.880 --> 11:09.140
<i>This person is older than the chief?!</i>

11:06.010 --> 11:09.140
<b>32 Years Old</b>

11:10.050 --> 11:13.110
<i>In other words, she's older than </i>me<i>?!</i>

11:14.650 --> 11:19.900
I heard about Yuki-san from Yume. 
He's really quite a large cat.

11:20.730 --> 11:23.570
Huh? Come to think of it, 
where did they go?!

11:23.570 --> 11:27.980
Yume pulled him up to 
the second floor just now.

11:28.430 --> 11:31.160
She probably ran to my mother's room.

11:31.840 --> 11:36.210
By mother, do you mean 
Chief O-Orizuka's mother?

11:36.210 --> 11:38.600
Oh, he didn't tell you?

11:38.600 --> 11:41.470
This is our family home.

11:43.100 --> 11:45.720
We used it for the party 
because it's spacious.

11:46.240 --> 11:49.080
Would you like to see the room 
my little brother grew up in?

11:50.310 --> 11:52.450
His graduation album is here, too.

11:52.450 --> 11:54.150
I-I-I wouldn't dare!

11:54.670 --> 11:56.230
<i>You should have told me, Chief!</i>

11:56.230 --> 11:57.980
<i>I feel awkward now!</i>

12:01.240 --> 12:04.400
Yuki-chan! Over here! Over here!

12:07.440 --> 12:10.340
There's someone I want you 
to meet on the second floor!

12:10.340 --> 12:12.010
My grandma!

12:14.370 --> 12:18.500
It's okay to come up. 
Grandma used to have a cat, too.

12:21.230 --> 12:22.670
Jeez!

12:25.300 --> 12:29.370
All the kids who want to see all 
the UMYU-Sea stuff I collected! Come up!

12:29.370 --> 12:31.780
I have event-only stuff, too!

12:53.960 --> 12:55.340
Grandma!

12:56.790 --> 13:00.250
That cute voice must be from Yume-chan.

13:03.550 --> 13:06.870
Grandma's eyes can't 
see that well anymore.

13:07.570 --> 13:08.760
Grandma!

13:10.030 --> 13:12.860
This is the Yuki-chan 
I told you about before!

13:12.860 --> 13:15.140
Oh, my. You came to visit?

13:15.670 --> 13:17.150
Nice to meet you.

13:17.690 --> 13:19.650
I am Yume's grandmother.

13:39.360 --> 13:43.340
You really are a large and impressive cat.

13:48.010 --> 13:50.720
Your fur is very beautiful.

13:51.080 --> 13:54.310
It reminds me of the black cat 
I used to have.

13:55.730 --> 13:59.350
My cat became a part of the stars 
quite a long time ago.

13:59.730 --> 14:03.620
My cat was also very intelligent.

14:10.280 --> 14:11.710
Yume-chan!

14:11.710 --> 14:12.870
Yes!

14:12.870 --> 14:14.600
Where are you, Yukichi?

14:14.600 --> 14:17.310
Yume's mom wants to start the party...

14:18.390 --> 14:20.080
I-I-I'm so sorry!

14:20.800 --> 14:24.590
U-Um, he's definitely not a dangerous cat!

14:24.590 --> 14:27.190
Are you a part of Yuki-san's family?

14:27.190 --> 14:28.530
Y-Yes!

14:29.390 --> 14:31.180
What a lucky young lady.

14:32.230 --> 14:35.060
You are living with a lucky anko cat.

14:38.970 --> 14:41.520
My grandfather often told me

14:42.010 --> 14:44.320
that black cats are called anko cats,

14:44.320 --> 14:47.530
and they are lucky cats that 
bring their owners great luck.

15:00.850 --> 15:02.040
How nice.

15:03.250 --> 15:04.140
Right?

15:03.630 --> 15:06.550
Happy birthday, Yume-chan.

15:07.270 --> 15:09.110
Happy birthday, Yume.

15:16.120 --> 15:18.060
Yume-chan, happy birthday!

15:18.060 --> 15:20.240
So tasty. They're amazing!

15:20.240 --> 15:23.020
Are the buns homemade, too?

15:23.020 --> 15:24.790
Happy birthday!

15:24.790 --> 15:26.020
Wow!

15:27.160 --> 15:29.380
Say, "Cheese!"

15:31.110 --> 15:33.370
Thank you very much.

15:34.710 --> 15:36.640
Come again soon!

15:36.640 --> 15:38.230
See you again!

15:40.080 --> 15:43.620
I was worried about what 
would happen! I was so nervous!

15:43.620 --> 15:46.690
The cat suit zipper worked perfectly!

15:59.430 --> 16:04.030
Well, I was just thinking, what if 
you <i>were</i> just a man in a cat suit?

16:10.610 --> 16:12.700
It's been a long time since 
we've come by this park!

16:22.570 --> 16:26.410
You were curled up under 
that bench, Yukichi...

16:35.960 --> 16:38.640
<i>My grandfather often told me</i>

16:38.640 --> 16:41.470
that black cats are called anko cats,

16:41.470 --> 16:44.770
<i>and they are lucky cats that 
bring their owners great luck.</i>

16:52.810 --> 16:54.220
The moment I saw you...

16:54.870 --> 16:58.200
I was craving something sweet,

16:58.610 --> 17:02.070
so I thought you were an ohagi rice cake.

17:02.070 --> 17:04.290
Ouch! Ouch! Your claws!

17:09.590 --> 17:11.610
<i>Oh, that was today...</i>

17:12.050 --> 17:15.790
<i>Fukuzawa even managed to prepare 
a costume on such short notice.</i>

17:16.170 --> 17:18.600
<i>Did her friend Yuki-san come?</i>

17:21.200 --> 17:24.010
<i>Where did this realistic-looking
 cat suit come from?</i>

17:25.430 --> 17:26.690
<i>Scary...</i>

17:29.230 --> 17:30.990
<i>Thank goodness I had to work.</i>

17:31.430 --> 17:33.860
<i>I should buy her a souvenir to thank her.</i>

17:35.590 --> 17:37.560
<i>A few days ago...</i>

17:49.590 --> 17:51.500
<i>Slip in?! What am I thinking?!</i>

17:52.040 --> 17:53.760
Yukichi!

17:53.760 --> 17:55.430
It's too dangerous!

17:55.430 --> 17:57.800
It's definitely way too dangerous!

17:58.340 --> 18:00.630
Wait, what are you making?

18:02.620 --> 18:07.020
Huh?! Is that stuffed animal 
a present for Yume-chan?!

18:07.460 --> 18:08.990
Hey, Yukichi!

18:08.990 --> 18:13.360
I'm serious! I really want one!

18:14.030 --> 18:16.830
It fits so perfectly in my arms!

18:16.830 --> 18:19.740
And the shape totally triggers 
my motherly protective instincts!

18:21.190 --> 18:23.370
It makes me want to take care of a cat!

18:24.910 --> 18:27.160
Means no harm

18:31.670 --> 18:33.950
<i>In the end, he didn't make me one...</i>

18:35.190 --> 18:37.340
<i>Thank you for boarding this train.</i>

18:53.800 --> 18:55.980
<i>Worthless human...</i>

18:57.710 --> 19:02.250
<i>Even for a company drinking party, she's late...</i>

19:06.070 --> 19:08.980
<i>Every single time, she barely 
makes it on the last train...</i>

19:09.350 --> 19:12.210
<i>And she usually drinks so much she ends up 
passing out at the entrance...</i>

19:18.170 --> 19:23.720
<i>One of these days, she might not even 
make it home before passing out.</i>

19:24.580 --> 19:28.730
<i>Forget about being male or female... 
She's worthless as a living creature.</i>

19:29.200 --> 19:32.730
<i>At this rate, she'll never find a mate.</i>

19:36.230 --> 19:37.950
<i>Oh, Yukichi?</i>

19:37.950 --> 19:39.970
<i>Well, you know...</i>

19:39.970 --> 19:44.150
<i>I'm just taking a little break 
at the park nearby,</i>

19:44.150 --> 19:47.150
<i>but I'm so sleepy...</i>

19:54.460 --> 19:56.130
<i>That fool!</i>

19:57.350 --> 20:01.720
<i>Natural selection culls creatures 
with no sense of danger!</i>

20:19.440 --> 20:25.090
<i>I'm definitely hitting that 
stupid face of hers today!</i>

20:27.600 --> 20:28.960
Yukichi...

20:30.000 --> 20:32.770
Another serving of rice!

20:42.060 --> 20:43.350
So tasty...

21:24.440 --> 21:29.290
<i>I'll wait for her near the station on 
the nights she goes drinking from now on.</i>

23:06.940 --> 23:30.260
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.390 --> 23:10.030
<i>I am a masterful cat.</i>

23:10.620 --> 23:12.670
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:13.570 --> 23:16.930
<i>You must be careful when 
taking pictures of a cat.</i>

23:17.580 --> 23:20.290
<i>Cats are sometimes surprised 
by the sound of a shutter,</i>

23:20.740 --> 23:24.140
<i>and the flash can cause great injury to their eyes.</i>

23:24.930 --> 23:27.870
<i>I hope you take care when 
taking cute pictures of them.</i>

23:28.690 --> 23:32.810
<i>Next episode: "A Masterful Cat Is Photogenic."</i>

23:30.260 --> 23:36.990
Can

23:30.260 --> 23:36.990
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Photogenic</b>

23:33.760 --> 23:36.120
<i>You may take my picture.</i>
